{"4705180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Black Void: HXV", "steam_appid": 4705180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, story-driven first-person horror experience set in a normally active research facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a normal workday quickly turns into a nightmare. Something has gone terribly wrong. The facility is placed under complete lockdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures prowl the halls. Survivors are being picked off one by one. And there is something else... watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the facility. Uncover the truth behind the breach. Survive long enough to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality begins to fall apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world around you shifts as forgotten memories blend with your own. Mysterious voices keep repeating the same message:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wake up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything you see is what it seems. The nightmare you're trapped in may be more than just a dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your back. Uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virun is just the beginning.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, story-driven first-person horror experience set in a normally active research facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a normal workday quickly turns into a nightmare. Something has gone terribly wrong. The facility is placed under complete lockdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures prowl the halls. Survivors are being picked off one by one. And there is something else... watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the facility. Uncover the truth behind the breach. Survive long enough to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality begins to fall apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world around you shifts as forgotten memories blend with your own. Mysterious voices keep repeating the same message:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wake up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything you see is what it seems. The nightmare you're trapped in may be more than just a dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your back. Uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virun is just the beginning.</strong></p>", "short_description": "You are trapped in a biological research facility critical to global research. You must explore, survive and learn the realities while something breathes down your neck in a complex laboratory enviroment.", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705180/b069aa7fa93e2cacd410776d26b48febee077347/header.jpg?t=1787255679", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705180/e5b099156723c3d963b475a26c2c4d76a417eadb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787255679", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705180/e5b099156723c3d963b475a26c2c4d76a417eadb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787255679", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 / AMD Radeon RX 590<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong>  DirectX compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</